<title>THAILAND: Thai bourse halts trade in First Asia.</title>
<headline>Thai bourse halts trade in First Asia.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand (SET) on Monday halted trade on shares of the First Asia Securities Plc during the morning session.</p>
<p>The SET said in a statement that First Asia had failed to satisfy a market request for the company to clarify progress of its recent merger with Securities One Plc.  </p>
<p>First Asia said in mid-January its merger with Securities One was likely to be completed during the first quarter.</p>
<p>First Asia said it would seek its delisting from the bourse within six months after the merger.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
